# Monthly Table Maintenance Review Memo

Audit date: 2026-09-01. The audit computes bloat_ratio as dead_pages / total_pages using round-half-up to 2 decimal places and computes size_class from total_pages only.

## Findings

- T-13 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because autovacuum_enabled False disables autovacuum and overrides bloat; computed size class large from total_pages 1000, ratio 0.50 over cap 0.2. Stats are 50 days stale and would tighten cap to 0.15, but autovacuum is checked first.
- T-17 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because autovacuum_enabled False disables autovacuum and overrides bloat; computed size class large from total_pages 1000, ratio 0.40 over cap 0.2. Stats are 50 days stale and would tighten cap to 0.15, but autovacuum is checked first.
- T-27 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed size class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 380 over total_pages 1000 rounds half-up to ratio 0.38, ratio 0.38 over cap 0.2; stale stats computed as 46 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15, and ratio 0.38 exceeds the tightened cap; days_since_analyze legacy field ignored
- T-04 is STALE_STATISTICS because computed size class large from total_pages 1000, stale stats computed as 45 days, ratio 0.10 under tightened cap 0.15; days_since_analyze legacy field ignored
- T-21 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED because vacuum_type manual overrides autovacuum even with autovacuum_enabled True, so autovacuum is disabled; computed size class large from total_pages 1000, ratio 0.20 over cap 0.2. Stats are 45 days stale and would tighten cap to 0.15, but autovacuum is checked first.
- T-26 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed size class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 180 over total_pages 1000 rounds half-up to ratio 0.18, ratio 0.18 over cap 0.2; stale stats computed as 36 days tighten the effective cap to 0.15, and ratio 0.18 exceeds the tightened cap; days_since_analyze legacy field ignored
